Welcome<%= ", #{@resource.first_name}" if @resource.first_name.present? %>.

<% if @resource.client.present? -%>
  <%= @resource.client.name %> has invited you to join them on Salato, where Kenyan
  organisers sell tickets, take M-Pesa and card payments, and check people in at
  the door with a phone.
<% else -%>
  You've been invited to join Salato, where Kenyan organisers sell tickets, take
  M-Pesa and card payments, and check people in at the door with a phone.
<% end -%>

Set your password below and the account is yours.

YOUR ACCOUNT
Name:  <%= [@resource.first_name, @resource.last_name].compact_blank.join(' ') %>
Email: <%= @resource.email %>
<% if @resource.client.present? -%>
  Organisation: <%= @resource.client.name %>
<% end -%>
<% if @resource.role.present? -%>
  Role:  <%= @resource.role.titleize %>
<% end -%>

Accept your invitation:
<%= accept_invitation_url(@resource, invitation_token: @token) %>
<% if @resource.invitation_due_at -%>

  This invitation expires on <%= l(@resource.invitation_due_at, format: :'devise.mailer.invitation_instructions.accept_until_format') %>.
<% end -%>

